    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n32197" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἔκ-κλυσμα</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ατος</span>,
			τό, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>that which is washed away,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ τῆς ἡδονῆς ἔ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Plu.
					2.1089b
				</span></i>
			 ; <i>that which is washed up, produce of the sea,</i> of
			purple dye, Zos.Alch.<i><span class="en">
